    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Serving Home Operator Guide",
      "description": "Action: use Serving Verdict and Evidence Cards to triage in 5 seconds. No Data in evidence cards means check Observability / Data Quality before assuming healthy zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Serving Home — 운영 트리아지 진입점 / operator triage surface\n\n이 화면은 **운영자 트리아지 진입점**입니다. 첫 화면에서 \"현재 상태가 무엇인지, 사용자 영향이 있는지, 증거가 신뢰할 수 있는지, 다음에 무엇을 해야 하는지\"를 확인합니다.\n\n- **HEALTHY ACTIVE**: 사용자 트래픽이 있고 모든 핵심 증거가 정상입니다.\n- **IDLE WARM**: 사용자 트래픽은 없지만 GPU가 warm 상태이고 readiness·scrape 증거가 정상입니다. 대기 중 정상 상태입니다.\n- **IDLE COLD**: 사용자 트래픽이 없고 warm-state 증거(readiness/headroom/scrape)가 누락되거나 degraded 상태입니다.\n- **USER IMPACT**: 5xx 비율 또는 지연이 임계값을 초과했습니다. API Experience와 Model Runtime Deep Dive를 확인하세요.\n- **CAPACITY RISK**: GPU headroom이 낮거나 OOM/재시작 이벤트가 감지되었습니다. GPU Capacity and OOM Risk를 확인하세요.\n- **OBSERVABILITY DEGRADED**: 예상보다 적은 scrape 타겟이 보입니다. Observability / Data Quality를 확인하세요.\n- **NO DATA**: Prometheus에 신뢰할 수 있는 런타임 데이터가 없습니다. 숫자 0과는 다릅니다.\n\nDrill-down 순서: GPU 압력·OOM → GPU Capacity and OOM Risk. Queue·KV 압력 → Model Runtime Deep Dive. Chat 지연·streaming → API Experience. Risk timeout·detector → Risk Signal Operations. Scrape·metric 신선도 → Observability / Data Quality.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Serving Verdict",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: HEALTHY ACTIVE (code 4) or IDLE WARM (code 3) means the stack is ready. Attention/주의: IDLE COLD (code 2) or OBSERVABILITY DEGRADED (code 5) needs triage. Action Required/조치 필요: USER IMPACT (code 7) or CAPACITY RISK (code 6) requires immediate drill-down. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: verdict recording rule absent — check observability_data_quality.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ai_serving_verdict_code",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "verdict"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "2": {
                  "text": "IDLE COLD",
                  "color": "yellow"
                },
                "3": {
                  "text": "IDLE WARM",
                  "color": "blue"
                },
                "4": {
                  "text": "HEALTHY ACTIVE",
                  "color": "green"
                },
                "5": {
                  "text": "OBSERVABILITY DEGRADED",
                  "color": "orange"
                },
                "6": {
                  "text": "CAPACITY RISK",
                  "color": "orange"
                },
                "7": {
                  "text": "USER IMPACT",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "NO DATA",
                  "color": "gray"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "NO DATA",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "gray",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 4
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 7
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "State",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: overall_runtime_status and service_readiness_status are 1. Action Required/조치 필요: 0 means a readiness path failed. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: readiness metric absent or scrape down — do not read No Data as 0.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(overall_runtime_status)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "runtime"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Not Ready",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Ready",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "gray",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "User Traffic",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: non-zero means active user sessions. Attention/주의: 0 is blue (not red) — idle is normal. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: gateway scrape is missing; 0 is suppressed when exporter is absent so this shows No Data rather than false zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=~\"$user_route\",route!~\"/health|/ready|/v1/models|/metrics|/docs|/openapi.json\"}[$window])) or on() (sum(up{job=\"gateway\"}) * 0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "user requests"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Metric Unavailable",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape Targets",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: visible count equals 7 expected. Attention/주의: below 7 means a target is missing or misconfigured — open Observability / Data Quality. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: Prometheus up series absent. The expected critical target count is projected from gateway + risk-adapter + vLLM runtime targets + dcgm + cadvisor.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up{job=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|vllm-runtimes|dcgm-exporter|cadvisor\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "visible"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(up{job=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|vllm-runtimes|dcgm-exporter|cadvisor\"})",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "up"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No Target Data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 7
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "GPU Headroom",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: selected-range minimum VRAM headroom stays above 6 GiB. Attention/주의: 4-6 GiB is orange. Action Required/조치 필요: below 4 GiB is red. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: GPU exporter absent — do not read No Data as zero headroom.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min_over_time(gpu_memory_headroom_bytes[$__range])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "min headroom"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "GPU Exporter Absent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 4294967296
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 6442450944
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "OOM / Restart",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: 0 OOM events and 0 container start-time changes when cAdvisor scrape is green. Action Required/조치 필요: any value above 0 requires drill-down to GPU Capacity and OOM Risk. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: cAdvisor source metric absent — do not read No Data as 0.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(container_oom_events_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|main-llm-vllm|embedding-vllm|risk-prompt-vllm\"}[$window]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "oom events"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(changes(container_start_time_seconds{container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|main-llm-vllm|embedding-vllm|risk-prompt-vllm\"}[$window]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "restart signals"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "cAdvisor Absent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Runtime Capacity",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: max KV cache pressure and max queue depth are near zero at idle. Attention/주의: KV above 0.8 or queue above 10 needs attention. Action Required/조치 필요: KV above 0.9 or OOM risk. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: vLLM metric absent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max_over_time(vllm_kv_cache_usage_ratio{model=~\"$model\",runtime_service=~\"$runtime_service\"}[$__range])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "max KV"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "vLLM Absent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Needs Attention",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: all signals below threshold — no action needed. Attention/주의: orange rows need monitoring. Action Required/조치 필요: red rows need immediate drill-down. No Data in a row means the exporter for that signal is absent — open Observability / Data Quality to diagnose.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace((count(up{job=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|vllm-runtimes|dcgm-exporter|cadvisor\"}) or vector(0)), \"area\", \"Observability\", \"\", \"\"), \"suggested_action\", \"Open: Observability / Data Quality\", \"\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Visible Targets"
        },
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace((min_over_time(gpu_memory_headroom_bytes[$__range])), \"area\", \"GPU Capacity\", \"\", \"\"), \"suggested_action\", \"Open: GPU Capacity and OOM Risk\", \"\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "Min GPU Headroom (bytes)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace((sum(increase(container_oom_events_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|main-llm-vllm|embedding-vllm|risk-prompt-vllm\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)), \"area\", \"OOM / Restart\", \"\", \"\"), \"suggested_action\", \"Open: GPU Capacity and OOM Risk\", \"\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "OOM / Restart Events"
        },
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace((sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=~\"/v1/chat/completions|/v1/embeddings|/v1/risk/.*\",route!~\"/health|/ready|/v1/models|/metrics|/docs|/openapi.json\"}[$__range])) or on() (sum(up{job=\"gateway\"}) * 0)), \"area\", \"User Traffic\", \"\", \"\"), \"suggested_action\", \"No action if idle expected. Open: API Experience if 5xx present.\", \"\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "User Requests in Range"
        },
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace((max_over_time(vllm_kv_cache_usage_ratio{model=~\"$model\",runtime_service=~\"$runtime_service\"}[$__range]) or vector(0)), \"area\", \"Runtime Capacity\", \"\", \"\"), \"suggested_action\", \"Open: Model Runtime Deep Dive\", \"\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "E",
          "legendFormat": "Max KV Cache Pressure"
        }
      ],
