    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Min GPU Headroom",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: minimum over selected range stays above 6 GiB. Attention/주의: 4-6 GiB means pressure may have occurred. Action Required/조치 필요: below 4 GiB indicates OOM risk. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: GPU exporter absent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min_over_time(gpu_memory_headroom_bytes[$__range])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "min headroom"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "GPU Exporter Absent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 4294967296
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 6442450944
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Max KV Cache Pressure",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: max KV pressure stays below 0.8 in range. Attention/주의: 0.8-0.9 is elevated. Action Required/조치 필요: above 0.9 can precede OOM. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: vLLM KV metric absent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max_over_time(vllm_kv_cache_usage_ratio{model=~\"$model\",runtime_service=~\"$runtime_service\"}[$__range])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "max KV"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "vLLM Absent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Container OOM / Restart Signals",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: 0 OOM events and 0 restart signals in selected range when cAdvisor scrape is green. Action Required/조치 필요: any value above 0 requires GPU Capacity and OOM Risk drill-down. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: cAdvisor source metric absent — do not read No Data as 0.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(container_oom_events_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|main-llm-vllm|embedding-vllm|risk-prompt-vllm\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "oom events"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(changes(container_start_time_seconds{container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|main-llm-vllm|embedding-vllm|risk-prompt-vllm\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "restart signals"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "cAdvisor Absent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "VRAM Used vs Budget",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: used VRAM remains under budget lines. Attention/주의: approaching 40-43 GiB budget lines. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: DCGM memory metrics absent. GPU warm residency during idle is normal — high VRAM used at idle is expected.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
